      "name": "CCS-100 optical sample-in-vacuum cryostat, 4 K-class cold head (408)",
      "configuration_basis": "catalog combination of documented options; install status is a catalog assumption. The cold head is a required ordering choice with no documented default; this configuration assumes the 408 head (1 W at 4.2 K), the smallest 4 K head consistent with the '<4 K' lower bound. The 204N (3 W at 10 K) and 204 (7 W at 20 K) heads are 10 K-class options that would NOT reach <4 K. optical.clear_aperture is taken from the generic window guide ('standard 1.63 in clear view Environment by Janis window ports') and is therefore inferred_estimate. Cooldown time column mapping is from pdftotext layout and is inferred_estimate.",
